  GridProofRegistry
    ✔ 1. only the owner can register assets and issue batches (511ms)
    ✔ 2. issueBatch stores the batch and emits BatchIssued
    ✔ 3. duplicate asset, duplicate batch, unknown asset and empty batch are rejected
    ✔ 4. daily capacity guard: capacityKw * 25 passes, one kWh more reverts
    ✔ 5. interval capacity guard: 204000 kWh retires, 204001 kWh reverts
    ✔ 6. retire records the holder, emits Retired and accumulates grams per beneficiary
    ✔ 7. an interval cannot be retired twice
    ✔ 8. forged kWh, forged intensity and wrong proofs fail with BAD_PROOF
    ✔ 9. only the batch holder can retire, and a missing batch reverts
    ✔ 10. leafOf matches the JS leaf and verifyLeaf accepts every leaf in trees of size 1 to 5


